{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f5b81521b099b595a524f4c589351a42dc2859e1067f5a1cdee0734b21589ae", "ja": "（アイドル☆スポーツフェスは765プロが優勝した！\nこの後、歩たちはステージで歌を披露する予定だ）", "zh": "（偶像☆体育节由765事务所夺得了冠军！接下来，步她们要在舞台上献唱）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1afa375afc0d9eeddcb9b7cfa2b62404aaf3ff71bafd6639763a8aab6acfe1fa", "ja": "歩、MVPおめでとう。大活躍だったな！\n受賞インタビューもかっこよかったよ！", "zh": "阿步，恭喜你获得MVP。表现得太出色了！\n获奖采访也很帅气哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7df279c5cdb8b2e7bd5a321981a75712f66eb61453b4809cf05a8877e750d04d", "ja": "サンキュー……。でも、まだ信じられないよ。\nまさか、アタシがMVPだなんて……。", "zh": "谢啦……不过，我还是难以置信啊。\n没想到我居然会拿到MVP……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0cb1b03d41a9cfae965875b789012799a0ae12c7ce9fd7121c82a3ab9c86b9aa", "ja": "ねぇ、ホントにアタシでよかったのかな？\nもっとすごい活躍した人、いたと思うんだけど。", "zh": "那个，我真的没问题吗？\n我觉得应该还有表现得更出色的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4be89da4a90c15aa602833cc95f0ddacf8ac5508e46694db6880a40f4fc3d735", "ja": "たしかに。プロレベルのアイドルもいたけど……\n歩の受賞は、他の部分を評価されたんだと思う。", "zh": "确实。虽然也有达到专业水准的偶像，但是……\n我想，步获奖是因为其他方面得到了认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1898c29ebaacbc5a37fa70400ecdfaeaefe3c959513cbe2468fe57ea9b08657", "ja": "他の部分って？", "zh": "你说的其他方面是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b89b5539f938989b827be84e9f9e6d9c00e66a68af7c8c6b45c780f5acd6188e", "ja": "この大会は、アイドル☆スポーツフェスだろう？\nもちろん、競技での活躍や勝敗も大切だけど……。", "zh": "这次大赛不是偶像☆运动节吗？\n当然，偶像们在比赛中的表现以及胜负也很重要，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3082b8e214a90d5d18f204d64f7539bb446b37bbac7e1502b480a6a1916df883", "ja": "アイドルらしくスポーツに取り組む姿……\n歩の頑張った姿が評価されたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "以偶像的方式投入运动的身姿……\n我想，大家认可的是步努力拼搏的样子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ffede6bd2bdacd906532c96929988f35eb6dc9f6cb333565394775e3547ccf0", "ja": "あ、そっか……。アイドルって、お客さんに元気を\n与えたり、楽しんでもらうことが仕事だもんね。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……偶像的工作，就是给客人带来活力，让他们感到开心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "542eb1525dc4f83ff93d851b0796ae6504e93bfaf7bf11bfafc0d14f950a7b0d", "ja": "じゃあさ、{$P$}。\nアタシは、アイドルとしてMVPをもらったってこと？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。\n也就是说，我是作为偶像拿到MVP的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "761b619c0a1124def3953e98b72e38bb0640fae09827effbb01610593f83c999", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nだから、堂々と胸を張っていい！", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n所以，你可以堂堂正正地挺起胸膛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "598ca9bfb66a849502889b80ac6734835225eb62a98336eaf647c010a6336cb2", "ja": "アイドルとして認められた……へへっ♪\nああー！　練習、頑張ってよかったー！", "zh": "作为偶像被认可了……嘿嘿♪\n啊——！努力练习果然是值得的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8b63a392623b04793bdba7a916321cf326ebbd0e8cfda197b3f511078935f579", "ja": "あの練習のおかげで、見せ場とか作れたから……\n何度も素振りしてさ……それで……ううっ。", "zh": "多亏了那次练习，我才能创造出大放异彩的机会……\n反复练习挥棒……然后……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "488208f881de8feb825e47de79aa5f8ed753fbcbeb534ae592b20f2bb9e99c25", "ja": "そうだな。よく頑張った、歩。\n泣くのはいいけど、これからステージだぞ？", "zh": "是啊。你已经很努力了，步。\n哭一哭没关系，不过接下来就要上台了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "330b807b8b10f66fb122235fcebe0309fcbce72f1bd253bc7152eeaea1a49705", "ja": "ぐす……うん、大丈夫！　だって今日のMVPだよ？\nみんなの前で泣いてたら、カッコつかないもんね！", "zh": "呜呜……嗯，没事！因为我是今天的MVP嘛？\n要是在大家面前哭哭啼啼的，就太不像样了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2ebb0722f9ad7242fa04cdf10ceaf8b8061d5e3fda47fb5489ec7d5ad9d26a87", "ja": "ああ、そのとおり！　できれば俺の前でも\nビシッとしててくれたら、心配ないんだけどな。", "zh": "对，就是这样！要是能在我面前也一直保持干练的样子，我就不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a96029f299b0e5234f42189fc32eb18bac201ffd2c0b01f5b704fe274dafafbd", "ja": "えっ？　あ、いや……そ、それは、その……\n{$P$}はいいんだよ！", "zh": "啊？啊，不是……那、那个……在{$P$}面前就没关系啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "941713c7bf02af40d03e0c5a85291860a021d64b6f3675a1aaebe936c0131627", "ja": "……ひとりくらいは、泣いてるとこ\n見せられる相手がいてもいいでしょ……？", "zh": "……至少有那么一个人，\n可以让我展现自己哭泣的样子，也没什么不好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e56812885bad52f83377f8544ef58ebea1c1fa48779c57b89a7af0cf9a28110d", "ja": "そ、そうだな……よし、存分に泣いていいぞ！\nいくらでも胸を貸してやるからな！", "zh": "对、对啊……好，那就尽情哭吧！\n不管哭多久，我都借你肩膀靠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0204_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc47c3325c2a3b867f80544f936c8feaf124fd871cbf615ae2b0fd16b0b9ef4f", "ja": "ちょっ！　な、何言って……ああ、もう！\nそんなのどうでもいいから、さっさと行くよ！？", "zh": "等、等一下！你、你在说什么啊……真是的！\n那些都无所谓了，快点走吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
